{"id":"strelka","lemma":"стрелка","pos":"noun","rank":3310,"glosses":["hand (on a clock or watch)","needle, pointer, indicator (on a dial or meter)","railroad switch, (set of) points"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"стрелки","plural":"стрелки"},"examples":[{"text":"Надеюсь, они поймают стрелка.","en":"I hope they catch the shooter.","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to catch, to take","l":"поймать"},null]},{"text":"Стрелка указывает путь.","en":"The arrow indicates the way to go.","words":[null,{"g":"to show, to indicate","l":"указывать"},{"g":"way, path, road"}]},{"text":"У моих часов одна стрелка отвалилась.","en":"One of the hands has fallen off my watch.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"hour","l":"час"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Вам зелёная стрелка горит.","en":"You've got a green arrow.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"green","l":"зелёный"},null,{"g":"to burn","l":"гореть"}]},{"text":"У часов две стрелки.","en":"A clock has two hands.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"hour","l":"час"},{"g":"two","l":"два"},null]}]}